    }
  },
  "translations": [
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0014",
      "source_sha256": "34ae3ce6ac4c8296",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 10,
      "text": "Let this alone suffice for them to say together, from the patriarchs to the prophets and the apostles and all the saints, rebuking our shamelessness:"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0058",
      "source_sha256": "fbcda8509c331166",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 10,
      "text": "“I remembered God and rejoiced.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0059",
      "source_sha256": "3adfcf4a07c49735",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 10,
      "text": "You, however, rejoice over deeds that should cause you grief when you do them, and you take comfort in the company of people who oppose God and his laws."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0060",
      "source_sha256": "2b0e944e476f2269",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 10,
      "text": "But we read: “I did not sit in their assembly while they were laughing.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0061",
      "source_sha256": "31a99ca22fffd555",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 10,
      "text": "And: “I did not sit with a worthless assembly.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0062",
      "source_sha256": "3ea52e8e67cb81a7",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 10,
      "text": "“I hated the gathering of those who are wicked, and I will not sit with the ungodly.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0074",
      "source_sha256": "0acc7aa805d82683",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 10,
      "text": "“Exalt the Lord with me, and exalt his name together.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0076",
      "source_sha256": "d98361534715f0ac",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 10,
      "text": "I therefore beg anyone who has not [?] sinned to continue guarding himself."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0077",
      "source_sha256": "75843d0cc4ecae64",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 10,
      "text": "And I also beg anyone who is entangled in it to flee from it, as one being freed from it through these words; and anyone who has resolved in his heart not to sin after hearing these words, not to continue doing it."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_seeks#CopScr.shenoute-seeks.000.0078",
      "source_sha256": "a2ebe7af0d041367",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 10,
      "text": "And if we all resolve in our hearts not to sin from the day we heard these words, we believe—and we will not doubt—that Jesus will forgive us for everything we have done."
    }
  ]
}
